Export readoutput() so mapfile's no-mmap fallback links.

When configure finds no mmap (the darwin-x86_64 cross, cosmo), the
mapfile module reads files through exec.c's readoutput(), which zsh
5.9.1 declares static: "undeclared identifier". Upstream master reads
through zstuff() instead, so drop this patch at the bump past 5.9.1.

--- a/Src/exec.c
+++ b/Src/exec.c
@@ -4729,7 +4729,7 @@
  */
 
 /**/
-static LinkList
+mod_export LinkList
 readoutput(int in, int qt, int *readerror)
 {
     LinkList ret;
